# Copy to .env.release, which git ignores, and fill in the values. The macOS
# release reads this file, so a release needs no exports in a shell profile.
#
# The App Store Connect key that notarises the build. Neither of these is a
# secret: the key id and the issuer are useless without the .p8 itself.
APPLE_API_KEY=XXXXXXXXXX
APPLE_API_ISSUER=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# Where the .p8 is. Name one or the other, not both. A 1Password reference
# keeps the key out of the file system:
APPLE_API_KEY_OP="op://Private/Apple notary key/AuthKey.p8"
#APPLE_API_KEY_PATH=~/private_keys/AuthKey_XXXXXXXXXX.p8

# Leave all three unset to notarise with the Apple ID and app-specific
# password in the nethack-tiles-notary keychain item instead.
